MULTILAYER SWITCHING
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Router is configured with inter VLAN routing. In inter VLAn routing, router is in-charge of the following:
1. Inter vlan router
2. routing of packets to internet
3. routing of packets to branch offices


L3SW - Device use for multilayer switching
- Can operates both at layer 2 and later 3.
- can check layer 3 IP Addresses.
- Relieves the work of router in inter VLAN router,
- the ROAS IP addresses will be configured to L3SW called SVI - Switch Virtual Interface




